---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---

<section class="sec" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <span class="tag">How it works</span>
    <h2 id="how-title">Set it up once. We handle the rest.</h2>
    <p>Four steps from glovebox to never worrying about it again.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="step s-lilac">
      <span class="no" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <h3>Create an account</h3>
      <p>Sign up with Google or your email and confirm it with a 6-digit code.</p>
      <span class="snip"><Icon name="user" />Takes under a minute</span>
    </li>
    <li class="step d-licence">
      <span class="no" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <h3>Snap your licence</h3>
      <p>
        Upload a photo of your vehicle licence. We read the plate, make, model, engine and chassis
        numbers for you.
      </p>
      <span class="snip"
        ><Icon name="spark" style="color:var(--mint-i)" />Read from your licence</span
      >
    </li>
    <li class="step d-insurance">
      <span class="no" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <h3>Get reminded early</h3>
      <p>
        Add your insurance and roadworthiness dates. We send reminders by SMS and email weeks before
        each expiry.
      </p>
      <span class="snip"
        ><Icon name="bell" style="color:var(--coral)" />Insurance due in 14 days</span
      >
    </li>
    <li class="step d-road">
      <span class="no" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <h3>Renew in a tap</h3>
      <p>
        Pay from your wallet or by card. We process the renewal and deliver the new papers to your
        door.
      </p>
      <span class="snip"><Icon name="truck" style="color:var(--mint-i)" />Out for delivery</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
